{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvSGVhcnQlMjBBbmQlMjBTb3VscyUyMCUyODE5OTMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Heart And Souls","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jnMBqMSUwa0Lzh9X1Fwo4f8AMl6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/orjpvbnfiDQvqRJIy9cLAb8WTgF.jpg","description":"A fateful night in 1959, four people die when the bus they are riding crashes. They continue as ghosts; their souls become eternally entwined to the life of a child born at the moment of their deaths as his guardians. Baby Thomas grows up to be a businessman who has memories of his playmates, but assumes they are products of his youthful imagination. When the ghosts realize they need Thomas' help to move on to the afterlife, they decide to make an appearance once more.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 13 Aug 1993 · United States of America · Language: English · 104 min\nStudio: Alphaville Films, Stampede Entertainment, Universal Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"1993","genres":["Fantasy","Comedy","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","imdb_id":"tt0107091","moviedb_id":12187,"tmdbId":12187,"runtime":"104 min","cast":["Robert Downey Jr.","Charles Grodin","Alfre Woodard","Kyra Sedgwick","Tom Sizemore","David Paymer","Elisabeth Shue","Bill Calvert"],"director":["Ron Underwood"],"writer":["Brent Maddock","Erik Hansen","Gregory Hansen"],"released":"1993-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The story of four souls who needed a body and one guy who needed some soul.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ron Underwood","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3MxNvsTCxQIuAmEnmr5lRgxS20G.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Thomas Reilly","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f9toX5MahujsDZTJoKIa5kzdhAE.jpg"},{"name":"Charles Grodin","character":"Harrison Winslow","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wRlpdMoxZ4FhFZ7Ttbs3pb